#: src/architecture/request-lifecycle.md
msgid "**History and memory are separate.** Session history preserves conversation, tool-call, and tool-result continuity. Explicit memory writes persist selected entries in the memory backend. Receipts ride in-band in the conversation text rather than as a separate persisted artifact. For payload ownership details, see [Memory and payload lifecycle](./memory-payload-lifecycle.md)."
