#: src/maintainers/ci-and-actions.md
msgid "Manual trigger for building release binaries across the full target matrix: Linux x86_64/aarch64 GNU and MUSL plus armv7 and arm hard-float, macOS Intel/ARM, Windows x86_64, and `aarch64-linux-android` (built with the NDK). Use this to verify a branch compiles cleanly on non-Linux targets before tagging."
