#: src/sop/how-it-works.md
msgid "Run state is process-local by default. With `sop.persist_runs = true`, successful initialization of the default SQLite backend stores it under `<data_dir>/sop/runs.db` and restores active runs after restart. Initialization failure logs a warning and falls back to process-local memory."
