#: src/foundations/fnd-001-intentional-architecture.md
msgid "The plugin model means channels and tools can have independent release cycles. A bug fix in the Telegram channel does not require a new kernel release. The kernel's stability becomes the foundation that everything else builds on. Rapid iteration on plugins does not risk kernel stability."
