msgid "[stagehand](https://codeberg.org/singlerider/stagehand) is a production ZeroClaw bot. It watches the upstream release feed, bumps a [StageX](https://codeberg.org/stagex/stagex) package, builds it, verifies it reproduces by digest, pushes the change, opens a draft pull request, and announces the result. No human touches it until the PR exists."
